---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Remove sandboxes

Usage: sbt rm [OPTIONS] [SANDBOXES]...

Arguments:
  [SANDBOXES]...


Options:
      --all
          Remove every sandbox

  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -f, --force
          Don't ask for confirmation

  -h, --help
          Print help
